The following files in this repository contain work derived from
cloudflare/agentic-inbox:

  src/components/InboxPrimitives.jsx
      The inbox split-view geometry, the accessible list-row pattern
      (role="button" with tabIndex and Enter/Space activation), the
      sender avatar, the unread indicator and the loading skeleton shapes
      follow the corresponding components in that project.

  src/lib/email.js
      The date formatting, HTML-to-text stripping, snippet extraction and
      byte formatting helpers follow app/lib/utils.ts and shared/dates.ts
      in that project.

Modifications made for TaskMaster Pro:

  - The visual implementation was rewritten against the TaskMaster Pro
    design tokens (brand palette, Inter typeface, neutral ramp) rather
    than the @cloudflare/kumo component library.
  - Icons were inlined as SVG rather than taken from
    @phosphor-icons/react.
  - Email bodies are rendered as plain text rather than in a sandboxed
    iframe, so no HTML sanitiser is involved.
  - Ticket matching, match-confidence display, the platform badge and the
    processed toggle are TaskMaster Pro additions with no counterpart in
    the original.
  - The split-view panel width was kept at the original 380px.

